WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680
On a spring night, a family sits
down to a meal in 15 fixed steps.

2
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:11.850
On the table: bitter herbs, salt
water, a roasted bone and flat bread.

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.810
The flat bread has no yeast in it at all.

4
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:19.370
Some families even set out a
new cup of water, for Miriam.

5
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:25.480
So why does a family retell the same
escape story at the same meal every year?

6
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.240
In this mission, you'll
read the Exodus story,

7
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.080
from the tenth plague
to the Song of the Sea.

8
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:35.440
Then you'll decode the seder plate, and
see how different Jewish families keep

9
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.580
the night.

10
00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:42.110
Your mission: find out why a family
retells the same escape story every year.
